<title>HUNGARY: CESI INDEX FIRMS OVER TWO PERCENT TO 1,538.81 PTS.</title>
<headline>CESI INDEX FIRMS OVER TWO PERCENT TO 1,538.81 PTS.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index firmed 33.23 points or 2.21 percent to 1,538.81 points on Thursday, said the Budapest Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The index reflects trends of 72 Hungarian, Polish, Czech, Slovak and Slovenian shares.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040.</p>
</text>
